# Chintu AI — Roo Code Autonomous Engineering Rules

## Direct Extension Integration
- Local AI Bridge is active on port 3042 (`http://127.0.0.1:3042/v1`).
- Master Administrator Authentication Token: `chintu_master_auth_permanent_veeresh`.
- The Express backend and React application support hot reload and dual-port socket binding (Port 3000 for UI, Port 3042 for Local AI Bridge).

## Core Architectural Invariants
1. 14-Board Analytical Voting Consensus: All quantitative trades require >= 9/14 supermajority votes.
2. Single Central Execution Engine: Orders must route through `centralExecutionEngine.executeTrade()`.
3. Multi-Broker Routing: Angel One (MCX Bullion), Zerodha (F&O Options), Groww (Equities Cash).
4. Strict Idle-on-Startup: Cold boot state must remain `IDLE_WAITING_ADMIN_START`. Only Master Administrator Veeresh can initiate trading.
5. Mathematical Accuracy: Zero fake modulo formulas, zero `Math.random()` simulation shortcuts in live or paper trading.

